<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Topstyle shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Topstyle shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Topstyle International Holdings Ltd was suspended in the last trading afternoon under the colonial rule at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of the silk garment maker gained HK$0.01 to HK$0.53 at midday on Friday with 548,000 shares traded.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
